            </div>
            <figcaption>
                <span class="fig-num">Fig. 01</span>
                <span class="cap">
                    The physical frame: perforated bridge, honeycomb wheels, battery, phone mount, and the Pi box. The iPhone senses and computes. Swift gathers. Rust decides. Bluetooth carries commands to the Pi.
                </span>
